<Base title="Tell Me About Yourself"><section class="interior"><div class="eyebrow">WORK / FRAMEWORKS</div><h1>Tell Me About Yourself</h1><p class="lede">A conversation-based approach to personal positioning.</p><div class="callout"><p>Rather than starting with a polished biography or a list of competencies, this interview begins with stories about the work someone actually loves doing.</p></div><div class="callout"><p>The questions explore the situations where they are most useful, the words that sound borrowed, and the details that make their perspective distinctive.</p></div><div class="callout"><p>The goal is language that feels true when spoken out loud (not a personal brand invented for a website).</p></div><p><a href="/work/">← Back to Work</a></p></section></Base>